            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mose wav'awi'laga V'aizilaeli ati', “Lingagi, Gu'ku' Mulungu wamusogolaga Bezaleli, mwana wamwa Uli, mwizu'ku'lu' wamwa Huli, wa igongo lya Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe wamokazyaga Loho ya Mulungu, na ku'mupa wu'tonto, wu'kowozi, masala na wu'manyi wa ku'v'ezya ki'la muli'mo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ki'gele iganike ki'v'ezezye cha mili'mo zya ku'sula mawe ga feza, zahabu na shaba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ku'pu'nza mawe ga ku'tu'u'la mu vyokazyo, na ku'pu'nza magogo, zyose zyeni'zi ku'nguno ya mili'mo zyose zya wu'manyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe wamupaga, mweni'ki'li' haki'mo na Oholiabu, mwana wamwa Ahisamaki, wa igongo lya Dani, wu'kowozi wa ku'v'ahembeka v'angi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wav'apaga wu'manyi wa ku'v'ezya ki'la muli'mo gwa wu'fundi na kwiganika ki'v'ezezye. Hangi' wav'apaga wu'manyi wa koola ku' mawe na ku'pu'nda ku' wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, na katani nsoga, haki'mo na ku'fuuma myenda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.35"
            ]
          }
        }
